      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LARA (1) turned in a better effort at Ballarat last start, finishing third behind Him Tarzan (22.56) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature in the finish again. MISS COCO (5) struggled to get involved last start after settling off pace at Shepparton, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at Warrnambool (22.62) beating Inga Amy in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on August 31. Should be about the money. PAW QUANDA (2) produced a moderate performance last time when seventh at Ballarat over 390m behind Taltarni Lane (23.05) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Goes well out of this box with a win and seven minor placings. Bold showing expected. LOCKED AND READY (3) is another with top-three prospects.",
